      "value": "<p>You gain Oath Spells at the listed levels and always have them prepared.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Paladin Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>Bless, Compelled Duel</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>Prayer of Healing, Zone of Truth</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>Remove Curse, Revivify</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>Banishment, Guardian of Faith</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>Commune, Dispel Evil and Good</td></tr></tbody></table><ul><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.ee18cfec5edaa7ad]{Bless}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.04499cbeb2e39e47]{Compelled Duel}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.c85b5001bf8a19ad]{Prayer of Healing}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.b62f0442a63524a1]{Zone of Truth}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.780e9dca2bdd5fcc]{Remove Curse}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.7100aeddd2f50099]{Revivify}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.a31456b1fff2e4eb]{Banishment}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.7280fefd0374fdf2]{Guardian of Faith}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.f5e5f9b00a48aa1e]{Commune}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.grimnir-lyonesse.spells.Item.7ad39f49c43d0986]{Dispel Evil and Good}</li></ul>"
